WEBVTT

00:05:56.042 --> 00:06:00.917
I've seen similar effects amongst people
of the same color in Africa.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:07.083
And how people of certain castes
are looked down upon in India.

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:11.018
The victims may be different,

00:06:11.042 --> 00:06:12.518
but the mechanism --

00:06:12.542 --> 00:06:15.643
the labeling and the lies --

00:06:15.667 --> 00:06:17.750
is exactly the same.

00:06:18.625 --> 00:06:23.518
And so you can see why people
are so keen to embrace the race thing.

00:06:23.542 --> 00:06:25.768
Because it gives the privileged,

00:06:25.792 --> 00:06:28.351
people like us,

00:06:28.375 --> 00:06:30.458
a get out of jail free card.